+
+    FP32 math on a BF16 residual ``[..., hc_mult, hidden]``: RMS-scaled mixes, ``sigmoid + eps`` pre weights,
+    ``sigmoid * post_mult`` post weights, softmax + Sinkhorn comb (``sinkhorn_repeat`` column normalizations).
+    Differentiable. Returns ``(post [..., hc, 1] fp32, comb [..., hc, hc] fp32, layer_input [..., hidden] bf16)``.
+    """
